## Feature Definitions

Each feature represents a business domain. The `jobs` domain is the core that
most other domains connect to. Enable only what you need.

**Core domains:**

<hick:feature name="customers" description="Customer management — contacts, addresses, referral tracking" />
<hick:feature name="jobs" description="Job tracking — the central entity connecting all cost and time data, with phase-based partial completion" requires="customers" />
<hick:feature name="payments" description="Payments and refunds — partial payments, processing fee tracking, balance due, fee recovery" requires="jobs" />
<hick:feature name="crew" description="Crew management — workers, roles, certifications, time tracking" />
<hick:feature name="inventory" description="Material inventory — stock levels, usage per job, reorder points" />
<hick:feature name="fleet" description="Fleet management — vehicles, equipment, maintenance, fuel tracking" />
<hick:feature name="overhead" description="Overhead recovery — fixed costs, allocation to jobs, recovery rate analysis" />

**Advanced domains:**

<hick:feature name="estimating" description="Cost estimation — linear regression on historical jobs to predict cost and quote price" requires="jobs" />
<hick:feature name="crm" description="CRM — lead pipeline, interaction logging, follow-ups, lifetime value, conversion tracking" requires="customers" />
<hick:feature name="sops" description="Standard operating procedures — step-by-step processes for franchise standardization" />

**Platform features:**

<hick:feature name="swiftui" description="SwiftUI iOS app for field operations" />
<hick:feature name="compose" description="Jetpack Compose Android app for field operations" />
<hick:feature name="avalonia" description="Avalonia desktop app for office management" />
<hick:feature name="spa" description="React TypeScript web dashboard" />
<hick:feature name="extension" description="Browser extension for quick job lookup" />

**Meta-features:**

<hick:feature name="all" description="All domains" requires="customers jobs payments crew inventory fleet overhead estimating crm sops" />
<hick:feature name="core" description="Essential domains for job tracking" requires="customers jobs payments crew inventory" />
<hick:feature name="financial" description="All cost-related domains" requires="jobs payments overhead estimating" />
<hick:feature name="mobile" description="Mobile platforms" requires="swiftui compose" />
<hick:feature name="desktop" description="Desktop platforms" requires="avalonia" />
<hick:feature name="web" description="Web platforms" requires="spa extension" />
<hick:feature name="frontends" description="All frontend platforms" requires="swiftui compose avalonia spa extension" />

| Feature | Description | Requires |
